{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "allay.builtin.effect-icons",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": { "zh-CN": "状态效果", "en": "Status effects" },
  "description": {
    "zh-CN": "屏幕右上角的状态效果图标一个个出现：正面效果一排，负面效果在下面一排。可以让其中一个快到期，图标变淡、越闪越明显，然后消失，旁边的补上来。",
    "en": "Status effect icons appear one by one in the top right corner: beneficial effects on one row, harmful ones on the row below. One of them can run out: its icon dims, blinks more and more strongly, then disappears and its neighbours close the gap."
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "category": "overlay",
  "tags": ["ui", "hud", "effects"],
